'''Doktor Heaven''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] event. She was added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 481
|rarity = LR
|name1 = Doktor Heaven
|name2 = Professor Abyss
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Professor Abyss''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==

As with the others in her set, this unit's versatility manifests through her interchangeable forms, though only her ability changes.

===Normal Form===
Her performance as a tank is questionable, since Dark enemies spawn in massive swarms with extreme DPS that can melt them in seconds, and Aliens often abuse status effects, such as Warp or Knockback, to deny her impact. It doesn't help that she has 400 range and 3 knockbacks, absolutely insane for a tank. All in all... just use her Evolved Form unless you really, REALLY need a tank that badly.

===Evolved Form===

Professor Abyss is much better than Doktor Heaven, as her capabilities as a nuker far surpasses her capabilities as a tanker. At just level 30 she has over 30k DPS against Dark and Aliens, and over 270k DPH, and she retains her massive health pool, making her one of the bulkiest nukers. However, she does have a few flaws - most notably her insanely long 8-second attack cycle, decently long 2-second foreswing, high cost of 5400, and, same as Doktor Heaven, lack of immunities. These do not completely destroy her viability, as if she is well protected she can erase the vast majority of Dark and Alien enemies with ease, but do beware of their impact.

