==Trivia==
*Professor Abyss may be a reference to the ''Made in Abyss'' character [https://madeinabyss.fandom.com/wiki/Bondrewd Bondrewd] given her name, similar outfit, obscured face, status as a researcher, and implied obsession with obtaining knowledge at any cost.
*Both forms' descriptions are inaccurate. They say she is either tough or deals massive damage, when in actuality it's insanely tough or insane damage.

